      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not put butter or Vaseline on a burn, as these can trap heat and worsen the injury. Immediately run cool (not freezing cold) water over the burn for at least ten to twenty minutes. After cooling, gently cover the burn with a clean, non-stick, sterile dressing if it has blisters. Seek medical attention right away, especially since blisters are forming.",
