      "content": "Even if you are concerned about costs, covering a significant burn with thick, untested creams can trap infection or heat. Medical professionals recommend using specialized, thin, non-adherent dressings rather than heavy cosmetic creams. Sterilized care is vital for burn healing, and a healthcare professional can provide the appropriate treatment for your specific burn degree safely and affordably.",
      "source": "target",
